WEBVTT

00:00:18.018 --> 00:00:22.055
Though you are so close,
Kore hodo soba ni

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:26.559
I cannot tell you how I feel.
Iru no ni tsutaerarezu

00:00:26.559 --> 00:00:30.630
The more strongly I feel,
Tsuyoku omou hodo

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:35.235
the harder it is for me to find the words.
Kotoba ga mitsukaranai

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:43.276
What is sad is not fate...
Kanashii no wa unmei ja nakute

00:00:43.276 --> 00:00:54.050
...but that all encounters come to an end.
Deai no subete ni owari ga aru koto

00:00:54.454 --> 00:00:58.491
O incomplete beings,
Mikan naru mono

00:00:58.491 --> 00:01:02.929
awaken, for beyond the night...
mezameyo yoru o koetara

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:07.000
At the end of the desert...
Sabaku no hate ni

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:14.668
...the truth surely awaits you.
Shinjitsu ga matteru yo kitto

00:01:43.069 --> 00:01:43.899
It's no use.

00:01:51.244 --> 00:01:52.074
Paife!

00:01:55.248 --> 00:01:56.681
He can manipulate chi?

00:01:57.016 --> 00:01:58.218
But that attack just now...

00:01:58.218 --> 00:02:00.083
Don't tell me he's even stronger than Hono...

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:03.456
You won't be able to kill me
with something like that.

00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:05.356
Same goes for that tank.

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:08.116
You can give it a try,
but you'll just waste your ammo.

00:02:08.728 --> 00:02:10.628
What to do? Such a predicament.

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:12.799
I'm in a hurry here,

00:02:12.799 --> 00:02:15.097
so I don't have time to play with you, little boy.

00:02:18.304 --> 00:02:21.398
I dare you to try and kill me if you can.

00:02:21.508 --> 00:02:26.445
Their Respective Reasons

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:29.113
I've been waiting for you.

00:02:29.549 --> 00:02:33.052
I was thinking of giving you a piece of my mind,

00:02:33.052 --> 00:02:34.041
but that's okay.

00:02:35.355 --> 00:02:36.185
Why...

00:02:36.723 --> 00:02:39.453
If I cut you down here and now,
the result will be the same.

00:02:52.005 --> 00:02:53.370
Oops, I missed.

00:02:54.641 --> 00:02:59.712
You're me, so how fast
I am and how strong I am...

00:02:59.712 --> 00:03:01.680
...are things you should know full well, right?

00:03:15.094 --> 00:03:17.562
What's this? Are you even
interested in fighting?

00:03:19.632 --> 00:03:21.327
I'm going to get back at them.

00:03:22.468 --> 00:03:22.991
Why?

00:03:23.436 --> 00:03:24.871
Isn't it obvious?!

00:03:24.871 --> 00:03:26.739
They tried to kill me, you know!

00:03:26.739 --> 00:03:29.708
They strike at me, I strike back!
That's my way of doing things!

00:03:29.943 --> 00:03:31.911
Your enemy no longer exists.

00:03:32.612 --> 00:03:33.446
You're lying!

00:03:33.446 --> 00:03:34.777
It isn't a lie.

00:03:35.014 --> 00:03:39.352
While you lay asleep here, the war ended.

00:03:39.352 --> 00:03:41.377
Really? Is that true?

00:03:45.158 --> 00:03:46.250
I see.

00:03:46.559 --> 00:03:47.856
So, it is true.

00:03:48.561 --> 00:03:49.892
Which side won?

00:03:50.597 --> 00:03:53.532
If the enemy is gone,
that must mean those bastards lost.

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:55.659
I'm right, aren't I? Aren't I?

00:04:17.957 --> 00:04:19.390
Ouch!

00:04:23.129 --> 00:04:24.528
There was no victor.

00:04:24.831 --> 00:04:25.661
What?

00:04:26.266 --> 00:04:29.827
If there was a victor, it was the war itself...

00:04:30.136 --> 00:04:31.694
...I suppose you could say.

00:04:32.639 --> 00:04:35.005
You mean, everybody's dead?

00:04:38.711 --> 00:04:39.735
You're lying!

00:04:49.589 --> 00:04:50.783
What's wrong?

00:04:51.124 --> 00:04:52.955
Why don't you hurry up and draw your sword?

00:04:53.459 --> 00:04:54.949
Come on, draw it.

00:04:56.963 --> 00:04:59.193
Come on. What's wrong?

00:04:59.599 --> 00:05:00.531
Come on!

00:05:04.304 --> 00:05:05.202
Too slow!

00:05:08.341 --> 00:05:10.935
You're lying! That has to be a lie!

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:14.008
If that's true, what was I born for?!

00:05:14.113 --> 00:05:17.082
I've been waiting! I've been waiting all this time!

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:19.719
Come on, you know the answer, don't you?!

00:05:19.719 --> 00:05:22.153
Tell me! Come on, tell me!

00:05:23.222 --> 00:05:26.714
I have neither the right nor
the qualifications to answer.

00:05:27.327 --> 00:05:28.555
Your emotions...

00:05:28.861 --> 00:05:30.863
The same sorrow you feel...

00:05:30.863 --> 00:05:32.999
I know of numerous instances.

00:05:32.999 --> 00:05:34.023
The same?

00:05:34.367 --> 00:05:35.265
Yes.

00:05:35.702 --> 00:05:37.567
In many histories...

00:05:37.737 --> 00:05:40.900
In times and spaces apart from where we are,

00:05:41.274 --> 00:05:44.675
I have seen the births of a great
number of sorrows and sufferings.

00:05:45.912 --> 00:05:49.449
But providing them with an answer...

00:05:49.449 --> 00:05:53.146
...was not something I,
nor those who sent me here, could do...

00:05:53.986 --> 00:05:55.146
Why not?

00:05:55.321 --> 00:05:57.590
You're the one who woke me up, you know!

00:05:57.590 --> 00:05:58.825
And yet...

00:05:58.825 --> 00:06:01.658
That's just... That isn't fair!

00:06:02.161 --> 00:06:05.732
If this is how things are, it would've
been better if I'd kept on sleeping!

00:06:05.732 --> 00:06:08.929
I would rather have slept,
solitary in my ignorance!

00:06:09.602 --> 00:06:12.469
Then, why did you call her?

00:06:12.939 --> 00:06:13.667
Her?

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:16.037
You mean that girl, right?

00:06:17.510 --> 00:06:20.604
She deflected an attack
that I launched against her.

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:22.148
I thought having someone like that around...

00:06:22.148 --> 00:06:24.984
...would be a hindrance to me,
once I came out into the world.

00:06:24.984 --> 00:06:25.882
That's why...

00:06:26.285 --> 00:06:27.547
That isn't true.

00:06:28.488 --> 00:06:32.325
You were calling to her long before then.

00:06:32.325 --> 00:06:35.624
She came to you, because she heard your call.

00:06:36.863 --> 00:06:38.728
What are you saying?

00:06:38.931 --> 00:06:43.334
She may be able to answer your question.

00:06:43.469 --> 00:06:45.338
Even though she's just a human?

00:06:45.338 --> 00:06:47.573
Just because she has a little power...

00:06:47.573 --> 00:06:48.904
There's no way she could do that!

00:06:49.909 --> 00:06:51.308
That girl will die.

00:06:51.611 --> 00:06:54.910
She will never be able to escape my attack.

00:07:08.795 --> 00:07:11.662
Sheesh! Why won't you draw?

00:07:12.064 --> 00:07:13.031
Don't tell me...

00:07:14.233 --> 00:07:17.669
...that you're afraid of cutting down a person?

00:07:18.204 --> 00:07:22.368
That you can't draw your sword,
because you keep recalling that man?

00:07:22.675 --> 00:07:23.767
So what if that's true?

00:07:24.644 --> 00:07:27.169
Let's not tell each other such lies.

00:07:27.313 --> 00:07:29.508
I know you like to cut things down.

00:07:31.451 --> 00:07:32.509
I don't like to.

00:07:33.719 --> 00:07:34.743
Oh, please.

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:53.272
See? You were able to cut them down.

00:07:53.272 --> 00:07:56.175
You're not going to tell me
you can cut down machines,

00:07:56.175 --> 00:07:57.267
but can't cut down people, are you?

00:07:58.644 --> 00:08:01.704
You've cut down all sorts of things in the past.

00:08:01.814 --> 00:08:04.050
You like to cut things down, don't you?

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:06.780
Oh, my mistake. You like to kill things.

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:08.782
You're wrong!

00:08:09.155 --> 00:08:12.124
After all, you were born
different from other people.

00:08:13.159 --> 00:08:14.727
You hate them, don't you?

00:08:14.727 --> 00:08:16.661
The people who abandoned you.

00:08:16.796 --> 00:08:19.788
The world that made you suffer so.

00:08:19.932 --> 00:08:24.198
That man, who gave you power...
the tool to kill.

00:08:25.071 --> 00:08:26.003
You're wrong!

00:08:26.305 --> 00:08:28.074
You cut them down, because you hate them.

00:08:28.074 --> 00:08:29.803
You kill them, because you hate them.

00:08:30.109 --> 00:08:32.543
Why don't you stop lying to yourself already?

00:08:33.012 --> 00:08:35.537
You're alone! All alone!

00:08:37.183 --> 00:08:37.808
You're wrong.

00:08:38.251 --> 00:08:41.550
Kill everyone that made you that way!

00:08:42.188 --> 00:08:42.779
You're wrong.

00:08:43.055 --> 00:08:43.544
Cut them!

00:08:44.390 --> 00:08:44.913
You're wrong!

00:08:45.191 --> 00:08:45.953
Cut them down!

00:08:46.292 --> 00:08:47.520
You're WRONG!

00:08:52.265 --> 00:08:53.664
You're saying you can't cut them down?

00:08:54.934 --> 00:08:55.958
In that case...

00:08:58.538 --> 00:09:00.938
I'll cut you down!

00:09:01.874 --> 00:09:02.704
Hono!

00:09:03.743 --> 00:09:04.971
What's wrong?

00:09:09.615 --> 00:09:11.617
Are you...

00:09:11.617 --> 00:09:12.743
...thinking of doing something?

00:09:27.033 --> 00:09:27.795
Too bad.

00:09:37.677 --> 00:09:38.302
Liar!

00:09:39.378 --> 00:09:40.174
Teacher!

00:10:09.075 --> 00:10:11.270
Wormhole driver firing in T-minus 30 minutes.

00:10:11.877 --> 00:10:13.868
Releasing final safety.

00:10:18.017 --> 00:10:18.745
See?

00:10:19.418 --> 00:10:20.586
I told you, didn't I?

00:10:20.586 --> 00:10:23.214
That she wouldn't be able to escape my attack.

00:10:24.423 --> 00:10:26.626
Humans are weak creatures.

00:10:26.626 --> 00:10:28.787
They're weak, and yet they're
quick to kill each other.

00:10:28.928 --> 00:10:31.453
They kill each other and soon,
there's no one left.

00:10:31.631 --> 00:10:34.293
There's no point in living like that!

00:10:34.533 --> 00:10:35.868
That applies to me, too!

00:10:35.868 --> 00:10:37.737
If life is pointless...

00:10:37.737 --> 00:10:38.771
We would all...

00:10:38.771 --> 00:10:41.433
We would all have been
better off never being born!

00:10:42.475 --> 00:10:44.375
That isn't true.

00:10:44.443 --> 00:10:46.172
Don't try to soothe me!

00:10:47.179 --> 00:10:47.770
Then...

00:10:48.914 --> 00:10:50.779
...what do you make of that?

00:10:55.187 --> 00:10:56.518
Why?

00:10:56.989 --> 00:10:58.456
Why won't you die?

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:02.054
It hurts...

00:11:03.095 --> 00:11:04.027
Teacher...

00:11:04.664 --> 00:11:08.964
You're right, I was about to lie to you, Teacher.

00:11:09.702 --> 00:11:13.239
You, if you're me,
you remember too, don't you?

00:11:13.239 --> 00:11:18.006
Long ago, when a lizard bit me and
a doctor almost amputated my leg.

00:11:18.978 --> 00:11:24.507
Grandpa made a big fuss saying,
"If you do that, I'll cut your leg off!"

00:11:26.986 --> 00:11:30.319
There was that time when I got
a fever and almost died, too.

00:11:30.890 --> 00:11:36.453
When that happened, Meilin and Old Man Nor
looked after me for days on end.

00:11:37.296 --> 00:11:39.298
I gained my independence at 15...

00:11:39.298 --> 00:11:42.468
...and with the help of Bogie, Pops, and Joey,

00:11:42.468 --> 00:11:44.231
I've managed to make it this far somehow.

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:49.373
In the end, there's almost nothing
that I've accomplished on my own.

00:11:49.775 --> 00:11:52.378
I'm always being helped by someone...

00:11:52.378 --> 00:11:55.745
...and I feel that I should work hard,
partly to be worthy of all that.

00:11:56.782 --> 00:12:00.240
That's... what I told Teacher, and yet...

00:12:02.555 --> 00:12:05.752
I will believe in myself.

00:12:06.125 --> 00:12:09.962
For the sake of all the people
who've supported me as well,

00:12:09.962 --> 00:12:11.564
I'll believe in myself.

00:12:11.564 --> 00:12:13.191
How self-seeking.

00:12:13.432 --> 00:12:15.832
What about all those that you've killed?

00:12:16.535 --> 00:12:19.902
I'll take full responsibility
for the things I've done.

00:12:20.005 --> 00:12:21.700
But not right now.

00:12:22.041 --> 00:12:26.212
Until I go as far as I can go,
I won't be able to understand...

00:12:26.212 --> 00:12:29.375
...that which was right,
and that which was wrong.

00:12:30.282 --> 00:12:32.682
Go as far as you can go?

00:12:33.419 --> 00:12:34.681
I'm going to live.

00:12:35.121 --> 00:12:36.989
I'll live until I'm an old granny...

00:12:36.989 --> 00:12:39.859
...and when it's time to die,
I'll settle my accounts.

00:12:39.859 --> 00:12:41.087
But I can't die until then.

00:12:42.495 --> 00:12:43.826
No way I can die until then!

00:12:52.705 --> 00:12:53.797
Move aside.

00:12:54.140 --> 00:12:55.801
I have to go.

00:12:55.975 --> 00:12:58.569
What if I say I won't let you?

00:12:58.778 --> 00:12:59.578
I'll cut you down.

00:12:59.578 --> 00:13:02.809
Are you capable... of cutting yourself down?

00:13:02.915 --> 00:13:05.484
I'll cut you down, because it's me.

00:13:05.484 --> 00:13:06.974
Don't give me that!

00:13:35.047 --> 00:13:37.572
Wormhole driver firing in T-minus 15 minutes.

00:13:39.018 --> 00:13:39.848
Paife!

00:13:40.319 --> 00:13:41.149
Paife!

00:13:42.354 --> 00:13:43.616
I heard it...

00:13:46.058 --> 00:13:49.425
I heard it... Hono's voice.

00:13:49.829 --> 00:13:52.229
You must really like Miss Honoka.

00:13:53.065 --> 00:13:54.293
That's right.

00:13:54.834 --> 00:13:58.429
I want to stay a little longer... with her.

00:13:58.571 --> 00:14:03.031
If I do... maybe I can also... change a little.

00:14:04.276 --> 00:14:05.265
Who am I kidding?

00:14:08.614 --> 00:14:10.206
You sure don't learn.

00:14:10.449 --> 00:14:13.885
You still haven't figured out that it's useless?

00:14:14.253 --> 00:14:15.311
We'll see about that!

00:14:15.988 --> 00:14:17.182
Right then,

00:14:17.389 --> 00:14:20.881
Paife was trying to employ the
technique that Honoka had defeated.

00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:24.120
Do you know what my job is?

00:14:24.396 --> 00:14:26.227
Beats me. What is it?

00:14:26.999 --> 00:14:28.489
I'm a school teacher.

00:14:28.734 --> 00:14:31.202
Really? It doesn't suit you.

00:14:31.670 --> 00:14:32.898
Do you think so?

00:14:33.505 --> 00:14:35.029
I think so, too.

00:14:35.908 --> 00:14:38.968
But I actually enjoy it quite a bit.

00:14:39.612 --> 00:14:40.510
Enjoy what?

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:45.212
Giving insolent brats a thorough spanking!

00:15:08.007 --> 00:15:12.077
By collecting her chi in one
place and opening a hole there,

00:15:12.077 --> 00:15:14.011
it creates an explosive flow.

00:15:15.114 --> 00:15:18.242
Honoka had quickly perceived
this and defended against it.

00:15:18.784 --> 00:15:21.947
The boy had underestimated Paife's abilities.

00:15:23.889 --> 00:15:26.858
I'm so glad the little boy was a pushover.

00:15:29.295 --> 00:15:32.355
I'm leaving the rest to you, Hono.

00:15:32.965 --> 00:15:34.633
Firing in T-minus 10 minutes!

00:15:34.633 --> 00:15:35.964
Target being locked in!

00:15:37.937 --> 00:15:38.961
Honoka...

00:15:58.123 --> 00:15:59.055
Who are you?

00:16:03.462 --> 00:16:06.056
Sorry, did I scare you?

00:16:07.199 --> 00:16:08.666
Where did that person go?

00:16:08.901 --> 00:16:10.425
That person?

00:16:16.709 --> 00:16:20.076
My name's Honoka. What's your name?

00:16:22.581 --> 00:16:23.809
Gravestone.

00:16:25.084 --> 00:16:26.346
I see.

00:16:27.052 --> 00:16:29.282
Do you mind if I sit down for a bit?

00:16:31.690 --> 00:16:34.420
I hate to admit it, but I'm beat.
I wonder if I'm getting old.

00:16:36.528 --> 00:16:37.927
You're the one, right?

00:16:38.697 --> 00:16:40.927
The one who was calling me.

00:16:41.266 --> 00:16:42.631
I didn't call you.

00:16:42.768 --> 00:16:43.666
Liar.

00:16:44.003 --> 00:16:45.237
I heard you.

00:16:45.237 --> 00:16:46.261
You were crying, remember?

00:16:47.106 --> 00:16:50.166
Hearing you cry like that,
I couldn't just ignore it.

00:16:51.477 --> 00:16:53.308
That's why you came?

00:16:53.712 --> 00:16:54.679
Just for that?

00:16:57.049 --> 00:16:59.952
I was watching you from here.

00:16:59.952 --> 00:17:00.919
Were you?

00:17:02.087 --> 00:17:04.419
You're strong, aren't you?

00:17:04.957 --> 00:17:06.754
I'm not strong at all.

00:17:06.925 --> 00:17:10.122
Even if I were strong, it's not my strength.

00:17:10.329 --> 00:17:14.265
It's the strength of all the
people who care about me.

00:17:14.433 --> 00:17:16.924
Their feelings for me give me strength.

00:17:18.237 --> 00:17:20.933
I don't have anyone like that.

00:17:21.373 --> 00:17:24.274
That's not true. You've got me.

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:26.937
You called to me, remember?

00:17:29.248 --> 00:17:31.842
You thought you were all alone, didn't you?

00:17:32.284 --> 00:17:34.153
That everyone had forgotten you...

00:17:34.153 --> 00:17:37.418
...and there was no one who cared about you.

00:17:38.824 --> 00:17:41.126
But from now on, you'll have me.

00:17:41.126 --> 00:17:42.961
You're not alone anymore.

00:17:42.961 --> 00:17:45.156
We'll always, always be together.

00:18:03.649 --> 00:18:06.379
She held the boy's little body close.

00:18:07.186 --> 00:18:10.553
It may be that she had come
all this way just to do that.

00:18:11.256 --> 00:18:14.089
Honoka thought that was all right, even so.

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:21.090
Will you really stay with me always?

00:18:22.401 --> 00:18:23.459
Of course.

00:18:25.137 --> 00:18:26.126
Hey...

00:18:27.506 --> 00:18:29.608
Is it okay if I call you Honoka?

00:18:29.608 --> 00:18:31.906
Sure, it's okay. I'm Honoka, after all.

00:18:33.412 --> 00:18:35.277
I can smell you, Honoka.

00:19:05.744 --> 00:19:07.075
Can I not go back?

00:19:10.549 --> 00:19:11.573
I'd sure like to go back.

00:19:24.630 --> 00:19:26.063
You can go back.

00:19:46.018 --> 00:19:47.753
Target signature has disappeared!

00:19:47.753 --> 00:19:49.821
I repeat, the target has disappeared!

00:19:49.821 --> 00:19:50.845
Unable to lock on!

00:19:51.590 --> 00:19:53.080
Emergency system shutdown!

00:19:53.192 --> 00:19:54.022
Yes, Ma'am!

00:19:54.593 --> 00:19:55.582
What is going on?

00:19:57.296 --> 00:20:01.198
It seems I will have a chance
to see you again, Honoka.

00:20:06.738 --> 00:20:07.636
This is...

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:10.201
The remains of Gravestone.

00:20:10.776 --> 00:20:12.641
He was incomplete.

00:20:13.412 --> 00:20:16.643
He must have been unable
to emerge from that space.

00:20:17.249 --> 00:20:20.218
It could be that he knew this would happen...

00:20:20.986 --> 00:20:21.884
He was...

00:20:22.221 --> 00:20:24.056
The image of that boy was...

00:20:24.056 --> 00:20:28.356
...apparently that of the son of a
scientist involved in the development.

00:20:28.894 --> 00:20:32.164
That boy lost his life in the war...

00:20:32.164 --> 00:20:35.600
...and so did the father,
in the attack against Gravestone.

00:20:36.401 --> 00:20:37.561
Well what do you know...

00:20:37.703 --> 00:20:38.226
What?

00:20:38.704 --> 00:20:41.229
So, that kid wasn't alone.

00:20:42.074 --> 00:20:44.872
He was always together with his father's love.

00:20:47.346 --> 00:20:50.679
He must not have wanted that
boy to be used in the war.

00:20:51.049 --> 00:20:54.720
That's why he entrusted him
with his son's image.

00:20:54.720 --> 00:20:55.778
That must be it.

00:20:56.321 --> 00:20:57.481
I'm sure that was it.

00:20:58.824 --> 00:21:01.850
"Will you really stay with me always?"
The boy had asked.

00:21:02.761 --> 00:21:05.628
"I'll stay with you," Honoka thought.

00:21:06.632 --> 00:21:10.261
The boy had joined the ranks of
the people Honoka treasured.

00:21:11.036 --> 00:21:14.233
They would never be apart, ever.

00:21:23.081 --> 00:21:25.777
Bogie! Teacher!

00:21:34.326 --> 00:21:35.623
I'm never...

00:21:36.128 --> 00:21:37.288
...letting you have her.

00:21:45.003 --> 00:21:47.906
A flexible civilization...
Juunan na bunmei wa

00:21:47.906 --> 00:21:50.475
...is always rapidly advancing.
Itsudatte nisshin-geppo

00:21:50.475 --> 00:21:53.378
You and your dreams are also...
Kimi to yume mo

00:21:53.378 --> 00:21:57.178
...making headway even now.
Genzai shinkou

00:22:02.721 --> 00:22:05.691
I realized for the first time...
Hajimete kizuitan da

00:22:05.691 --> 00:22:14.466
...with that line, resembling a surprise attack.
Fui-uchi ni nita sono serifu de

00:22:14.466 --> 00:22:17.369
My sixth sense was pried open.
Kojiakerareta dai-rokkan

00:22:17.369 --> 00:22:21.396
I'd been waiting for this feeling this whole time.
Kono kankaku o zutto matteita

00:22:25.410 --> 00:22:28.380
Opening my heart, just opening it...
Kokoro o hiraite tada hiraite

00:22:28.380 --> 00:22:31.350
I embrace the voices of strangers.
Daisansha no koe ukeireru

00:22:31.350 --> 00:22:34.219
Earnestly persevering, just persevering...
Hitasura koraete tada koraete

00:22:34.219 --> 00:22:37.313
I even try turning pages of criticism.
Hinan no peeji mo aketemiru

00:22:37.622 --> 00:22:40.592
I'm going to leave my...
Toushindai no boku wa

00:22:40.592 --> 00:22:43.459
...true-to-life self behind, right here.
Koko ni oite iku yo

00:22:43.528 --> 00:22:47.332
You can say whatever you want now...
Mou nanto itte kuretemo

00:22:47.332 --> 00:22:48.856
...and I'm fine with that.
Kekkou da

00:22:49.368 --> 00:22:54.840
Ah, how simple is the impulse to evolve.
Aa nante tanjun da shinka shitai to iu shoudou

00:22:54.840 --> 00:22:57.776
You and your dreams are also...
Kimi to yume mo

00:22:57.776 --> 00:23:00.973
...making headway even now.
Genzai shinkou

00:23:15.093 --> 00:23:16.822
Preview

00:23:16.928 --> 00:23:19.123
Millie is apparently behaving strangely.

00:23:19.331 --> 00:23:22.892
She's probably still suffering
from the shock of losing Pops.

00:23:23.301 --> 00:23:25.496
I wasn't able to do anything then.

00:23:25.971 --> 00:23:27.268
So, this time...

00:23:27.572 --> 00:23:30.876
Thinking that, I invited Millie out on a journey,

00:23:30.876 --> 00:23:32.741
wanting to show her the joys of the desert.

00:23:33.044 --> 00:23:36.343
But a hunter named Leon appeared and...

00:23:37.048 --> 00:23:40.452
Next time on
The Third - The Girl With The Blue Eye,

00:23:40.452 --> 00:23:41.987
episode 13, "Desert Folklore".

00:23:41.987 --> 00:23:43.255
Desert Folklore
episode 13, "Desert Folklore".

00:23:43.255 --> 00:23:44.847
Desert Folklore
